    "text": "Two particles of equal mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;are moving with velocities <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;respectively.&nbsp;If the particles collide completely inelastically, then the energy lost in the process is"
