  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Conserving momentum</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mv</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>On solving&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Change in K.E.&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>mv</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>)</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup>